# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# i have been leaked — environment variables
#
# NOTHING here is required. Every breach source is queried over a free,
# documented, keyless endpoint, so the application runs with an empty
# environment. This file exists so the (empty) contract is explicit.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# XposedOrNot — https://xposedornot.com/api_doc       (no key, 25/hour, 100/day)
# LeakCheck public API — https://docs.leakcheck.io    (no key, 1 request/s)
# Have I Been Pwned Pwned Passwords — https://haveibeenpwned.com/API/v3 (no key)

# Optional: only if you later add a keyed provider to netlify/lib/config.ts.
# MYPROVIDER_API_KEY=

# Optional: silences the outbound call spacing (useful in load tests only).
# IHL_DISABLE_THROTTLE=1
